SUMMARY:Stepping into Motherhood with Petit Lem
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the joy of new beginnings by Stepping into Motherhood\, a series of Toronto-based mom walks\, designed to build community in this season of motherhood. \nIn partnership with Olivia’s Garden\, new and expecting mothers are invited to come together for a gentle spring walk starting and ending at the café. Guests will enjoy coffee and pastries\, connect with each other\, and browse Petit Lem’s new Maman & Mini collection. \nSpace is limited; RSVPs are required.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/stepping-into-motherhood-with-petit-lem/
LOCATION:Olivia’s Garden\, 569 Crawford St\, Toronto\, ON M6G 3K1\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6G 3K1
CATEGORIES:Community Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/stepping-into-motherhood-with-petit-lem.png
END:VEVENT
