SUMMARY:TO Food and Drink Fest 2026
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for the ultimate foodie experience at T.O Food & Drink Fest! 3 days to treat yourself to delicious food from incredible chefs. Raise a glass to being with friends and enjoying life at the Metro Toronto Convention Centre. This exciting event showcases over 200 exhibits\, Master Chef Demos\, International Cuisine\, Food Trucks\, Wine Tasting\, Mixology Classes\, Live Music & DJ Lounge\, and a Dance Party on Friday & Saturday night! Indulge in delicious food and drink from some of the city’s top chefs and mixologists! Get ready to chow down\, party on\, and indulge in all the deliciousness that the T.O Food & Drink Festival has to offer!
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/to-food-and-drink-fest-2026/
LOCATION:Metro Toronto Convention Centre – North & South Buildings\, 255 Front St. W.\, Toronto\, M5V 2W6
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/to-food-and-drink-fest-2026.png
END:VEVENT
