SUMMARY:Startup Fashion Week™ Runway Show
DESCRIPTION:Startup Fashion Week 2026 culminates on Friday\, April 17 with its runway showcase at the Illuminarium\, spotlighting emerging Canadian entrepreneurs\, designers and other creatives shaping the future of fashion. \nAnchored by this year’s theme\, “In Bloom\,” the show introduces fragrance into the runway experience in partnership with Ratelier\, adding a new sensory dimension to the traditional format. \nPresented by Joey Cartz\, the runway features designers from across Canada\, including Rue de Mort\, Lure Apparel\, CarryOne\, EXERGONIC\, Soffio di Como\, 22 Lifestyle\, bad kitty kimono\, and Miedor Eporwei Bridal. \nRunway Show Details\nWhat: Startup Fashion Week 2026 Runway ShowWhen: Friday\, April 17\, 2026Where: Illuminarium Toronto28 Gristmill Lane \nSchedule:6:30 PM – Registration7:45 PM – Seating8:00 PM – Runway9:40 PM – Networking \nTickets / Info: https://sfwrunway2026.eventbrite.ca
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/startup-fashion-week-runway-show/
LOCATION:28 Distillery Lane\, 28 Distillery Lane\, Toronto\, ON M5A 4R2\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5A 4R2
CATEGORIES:Fashion
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/startup-fashion-week-runway-show.png
END:VEVENT
