SUMMARY:Sam Sferrazza - 'Artistic Intent' Stand Up Special Release Show
DESCRIPTION:Comedy darling and viral sensations Sam Sferrazza presets his second comedy album Artistic Intent. \nCome join a night of comedic celebration with some of Toronto’s best comedians in celebrartion of your headliners Sam Sferrazza’s new comedy album! \nToronto-based comedian Sam Sferrazza is proud to announce his sophomore stand up comedy album and debut special Artistic Intent will be released April 17\, 2026. Sam Sferrazza is a two time Juno Award winner for art directing and producing music videos for Grimes\, but now he’s coming for that Comedy Album of the Year category. Recorded live at The Second City in Toronto\, Artistic Intent is a queer patchwork quilt of impassioned rants that comes from eight years of honing his comedy craft. \nFeaturing Jackie Pirico (JFL)\, Nour Hadidi (This Hour Has 22 Minutes) + more!Hosted by Tamara Appleton. 
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/sam-sferrazza-artistic-intent-stand-up-special-release-show/
LOCATION:Tallboys\, 838 Bloor St W\, Toronto\, ON M6G 1M2\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6G 1M2
CATEGORIES:2SLGBTQ+,Comedy & Improv,Performing Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sam-sferrazza-artistic-intent-stand-up-special-release-show.png
END:VEVENT
