SUMMARY:The Sea Star Ball: An Evening of Romance\, Revelry\, and Wonder
DESCRIPTION:On Friday\, April 17\, Ripley’s Aquarium of Canada formally invites you to one of the most notable events of the season – the Sea Star Ball.  \nStarting at 8 PM\, step into a Regency-inspired evening of romance and revelry beneath the sea. Promenade through glowing exhibits\, sip cocktails worthy of the ton\, and learn to waltz among the stingrays. Dress to impress for a night of high-society fun unlike anything else in the city. \nHighlights include: \n\nA string quartet playing classical renditions of pop hits\nLive poetry writing \nComplimentary photo-ops to capture the evening\nSurprise giveaways throughout the night\nAccess to the whisky lounge\nA chance to present yourself to the Queen of the Seven Seas\nFood and drinks available for purchase\n\nThis 19+ event promises a one-of-a-kind evening of regal glamour and underwater wonder. Space is limited – reserve your ticket now for a night of elegance\, lively fun\, and unforgettable memories.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/the-sea-star-ball-an-evening-of-romance-revelry-and-wonder/
LOCATION:Ripley’s Aquarium of Canada\, 288 Bremner Blvd\, Toronto\, ON M5V 3L9\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5V 3L9
CATEGORIES:Live Music,Nightlife
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/the-sea-star-ball-an-evening-of-romance-revelry-and-wonder.png
END:VEVENT
