SUMMARY:Toronto vs Montreal REGGAE mash up  : The Human Rights & Okapi
DESCRIPTION:Toronto’s 10-piece modern roots reggae powerhouse The Human Rights play their first hometown show of 2026. Expect new music\, a full horn section\, and deep cuts from four albums including 2025’s One People. Joining them for the first time: Montreal’s Okapi\, bringing French-Canadian rub-a-dub and dancehall vibes in their Toronto debut. Special guests and DJs TBA. 9 pm / $25 / 19+
