SUMMARY:Latin Friday with Cafe Cubano + DJ Suave + Sarita Levya!
DESCRIPTION:Fridays\, we go to the tropics\, where the vibrant rhythms ignite our souls\, and live music\, dance lessons\, & DJs make it a perfect night! \nThis week\, Pianist Jorge Betancourt leads this now-legendary all-star Cuban ensemble\, known for its unique blend of salsa\, funk and timba.
