SUMMARY:SCREAMY TODD: An Improvised Revenge Musical
DESCRIPTION:Attend the tale of Screamy Todd! \nVengeance and justice! Antihero or villain? Judge for yourself in this razor-sharp\, completely improvised musical. \nThis killer Friday night offering from RATS! Another Musical? will have you singing\, “God\, that’s good!” And not to worry\, darling: nothing’s gonna harm you. \nRATS! Another Musical? is a musical improv troupe based in Toronto performing high-energy\, fully improvised musicals that draw inspiration from Sondheim\, sappy holiday rom-coms and everything in between. They are currently a House Team at Comedy Bar\, with two monthly shows: their marquee show at Comedy Bar Danforth and Way Off Broadway with Mirv-“ish” at Comedy Bar Bloor. RATS! is known for their musical complexity\, theatricality and strong commitment to narrative.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/east-side-story-a-totally-improvised-musical-comedy/
LOCATION:Comedy Bar Danforth\, 2800 Danforth Avenue\, Toronto\, M4C 1M1
CATEGORIES:Comedy & Improv,Performing Arts
